This project publishes a compatibility representation of public course data
made available by the NSYSU Open Development Community through
NSYSUCourseAPI (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 NSYSU Open Development
Community).

感謝國立中山大學提供課程資料。

The packaged file `src/cleargrad_course_api/assets/nsysu_captcha.onnx` is an
ONNX conversion of NSYSUCourseAPI's `EfficientCapsNetDeploy.pth` captcha model.
The original model and its inference implementation are distributed under the
same upstream MIT License. The conversion preserves the model weights while
removing the PyTorch runtime dependency.

Upstream project: https://github.com/NSYSU-OpenDev/NSYSUCourseAPI
Official course system: https://selcrs.nsysu.edu.tw/menu1

